<view class="page">
  <view class="title">设置与隐私</view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="row">
      <view>数据模式</view>
      <switch checked="{{useMock}}" bindchange="toggleMock" color="#3047b8" />
    </view>
    <view class="muted">当前：{{originLabel}}</view>
    <view class="caption" wx:if="{{useMock}}">示例数据模式不需要启动后端，克隆仓库后可直接跑通全流程；页面会标注「示例数据」，不会被误当成解析结果。</view>
    <view class="caption" wx:else>真实解析模式需要后端在运行：仓库根目录双击 start-backend.bat（或依次运行 npm run dev:ai 与 npm run dev:api）。当前地址 {{apiBaseUrl}}。</view>
  </view>
  <view class="card">
    <view>本地开发状态</view>
    <view class="muted">DEV_ONLY 登录；API 地址来自 app.js；客户端不保存模型密钥。</view>
  </view>
  <view class="card">
    <view>人工验收状态</view>
    <view class="danger">MANUAL_VERIFICATION_REQUIRED</view>
    <view class="muted">请按 docs/manual-wechat-verification.md 在微信开发者工具中逐项验证。</view>
  </view>
  <view class="card">
    <view>个人数据</view>
    <view class="muted">导出当前账号的画像、原文、解析结果、行动和任务；数据只从本地 API 返回。</view>
    <button class="button" loading="{{exporting}}" disabled="{{exporting}}" bindtap="exportData">确认并导出 JSON</button>
  </view>
  <view class="danger" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view>
</view>
